# 基础词 Unit24
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2025红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit24核心词汇

{{qualify}}{{/ˈkwɒlɪfaɪ}}{{v. 使合格；具有资格}}{{Her experience qualifies her for the position.}}
{{radical}}{{/ˈrædɪkl}}{{adj./n. 激进的；根本的}}{{The government introduced radical reforms.}}
{{random}}{{/ˈrændəm}}{{adj. 随机的；任意的}}{{The numbers were selected at random.}}
{{range}}{{/reɪndʒ}}{{n./v. 范围；山脉；排列}}{{The store offers a wide range of products.}}
{{rank}}{{/ræŋk}}{{n./v. 等级；排名}}{{The university ranks among the top 10 in the world.}}
{{rapid}}{{/ˈræpɪd}}{{adj. 迅速的；快的}}{{The city has experienced rapid growth.}}
{{rational}}{{/ˈræʃnəl}}{{adj. 理性的；合理的}}{{We need to make rational decisions.}}
{{react}}{{/riˈækt}}{{v. 反应；起化学反应}}{{How did she react to the news?}}
{{realistic}}{{/ˌriːəˈlɪstɪk}}{{adj. 现实的；逼真的}}{{We should set realistic goals.}}
{{realm}}{{/relm}}{{n. 领域；王国}}{{She made important contributions to the realm of science.}}
{{reasonable}}{{/ˈriːznəbl}}{{adj. 合理的；公道的}}{{The price is very reasonable for the quality.}}
{{recall}}{{/rɪˈkɔːl}}{{v./n. 回忆；召回}}{{I can't recall where I put my keys.}}
{{recover}}{{/rɪˈkʌvər}}{{v. 恢复；收回}}{{She has fully recovered from her illness.}}
{{recruit}}{{/rɪˈkruːt}}{{v./n. 招聘；新成员}}{{The company is recruiting new graduates.}}
{{reduce}}{{/rɪˈdjuːs}}{{v. 减少；降低}}{{The company reduced its workforce by 10%.}}
{{refer}}{{/rɪˈfɜːr}}{{v. 提到；参考；转介}}{{Please refer to the handbook for details.}}
{{reflect}}{{/rɪˈflekt}}{{v. 反映；反射；思考}}{{The lake reflected the mountains beautifully.}}
{{reform}}{{/rɪˈfɔːm}}{{n./v. 改革；改良}}{{The education reform aims to improve teaching quality.}}
{{regard}}{{/rɪˈɡɑːd}}{{v./n. 看待；尊重；方面}}{{He is highly regarded in his field.}}
{{region}}{{/ˈriːdʒən}}{{n. 地区；区域}}{{The tropical region has a warm climate all year.}}
{{register}}{{/ˈredʒɪstər}}{{v./n. 登记；注册}}{{She registered for the online course.}}
{{regulate}}{{/ˈreɡjuleɪt}}{{v. 管理；调节；规范}}{{The government regulates the financial industry.}}
{{reject}}{{/rɪˈdʒekt}}{{v. 拒绝；驳回}}{{The committee rejected the proposal.}}
{{relate}}{{/rɪˈleɪt}}{{v. 与…有关；叙述}}{{The article relates to the current economic situation.}}
{{release}}{{/rɪˈliːs}}{{v./n. 释放；发行；发布}}{{The movie will be released next month.}}
{{relevant}}{{/ˈreləvənt}}{{adj. 相关的；切题的}}{{Please provide relevant documents for the application.}}
{{reliable}}{{/rɪˈlaɪəbl}}{{adj. 可靠的；可信赖的}}{{She is a reliable colleague.}}
{{reluctant}}{{/rɪˈlʌktənt}}{{adj. 不情愿的；勉强的}}{{He was reluctant to admit his mistake.}}
{{rely}}{{/rɪˈlaɪ}}{{v. 依赖；依靠}}{{You can rely on me for support.}}
{{remark}}{{/rɪˈmɑːk}}{{n./v. 评论；谈论}}{{She made a remark about the weather.}}
{{remote}}{{/rɪˈməʊt}}{{adj. 遥远的；偏僻的}}{{The village is in a remote area of the country.}}
{{remove}}{{/rɪˈmuːv}}{{v. 移除；去除}}{{Please remove your shoes before entering.}}
{{render}}{{/ˈrendər}}{{v. 使成为；提供；呈递}}{{The accident rendered him unconscious.}}
{{renew}}{{/rɪˈnjuː}}{{v. 更新；续期；恢复}}{{She renewed her passport before the trip.}}
{{represent}}{{/ˌreprɪˈzent}}{{v. 代表；象征}}{{The dove represents peace.}}
{{reputation}}{{/ˌrepjuˈteɪʃn}}{{n. 名誉；声望}}{{The company has a good reputation for quality.}}
{{request}}{{/rɪˈkwest}}{{n./v. 请求；要求}}{{She made a request for more time.}}
{{require}}{{/rɪˈkwaɪər}}{{v. 需要；要求}}{{The job requires strong communication skills.}}
{{rescue}}{{/ˈreskjuː}}{{v./n. 营救；解救}}{{The firefighters rescued the trapped passengers.}}
{{research}}{{/rɪˈsɜːtʃ}}{{n./v. 研究；调查}}{{The research was conducted over three years.}}
{{resemble}}{{/rɪˈzembl}}{{v. 像；类似于}}{{She resembles her mother in many ways.}}
{{reserve}}{{/rɪˈzɜːv}}{{v./n. 保留；预订；储备}}{{I'd like to reserve a table for two.}}
{{resign}}{{/rɪˈzaɪn}}{{v. 辞职；放弃}}{{He resigned from his position as CEO.}}
{{resist}}{{/rɪˈzɪst}}{{v. 抵抗；抵制}}{{The material resists heat and water.}}
{{resolve}}{{/rɪˈzɒlv}}{{v./n. 解决；决心}}{{They resolved the conflict through negotiation.}}
{{resource}}{{/rɪˈsɔːs}}{{n. 资源；办法}}{{We must use our natural resources wisely.}}
{{respond}}{{/rɪˈspɒnd}}{{v. 回答；反应}}{{She responded quickly to the emergency.}}
{{responsible}}{{/rɪˈspɒnsəbl}}{{adj. 负责的；有责任心的}}{{Who is responsible for this mess?}}
{{restore}}{{/rɪˈstɔːr}}{{v. 恢复；修复}}{{The old painting was carefully restored.}}
{{restrict}}{{/rɪˈstrɪkt}}{{v. 限制；约束}}{{Access to the area is restricted.}}
{{retain}}{{/rɪˈteɪn}}{{v. 保持；保留}}{{The company retained all its employees.}}
{{reveal}}{{/rɪˈviːl}}{{v. 揭示；透露}}{{The investigation revealed surprising facts.}}
{{revenue}}{{/ˈrevənjuː}}{{n. 收入；税收}}{{The company's revenue increased by 20%.}}
{{reverse}}{{/rɪˈvɜːs}}{{v./adj./n. 颠倒；相反的；背面}}{{The court reversed the decision.}}
{{review}}{{/rɪˈvjuː}}{{v./n. 审查；评论；复习}}{{The professor reviewed the students' papers.}}
{{revise}}{{/rɪˈvaɪz}}{{v. 修订；修改}}{{She revised her essay before submitting it.}}
{{revolution}}{{/ˌrevəˈluːʃn}}{{n. 革命；旋转}}{{The industrial revolution transformed society.}}
{{reward}}{{/rɪˈwɔːd}}{{n./v. 奖赏；报酬}}{{Hard work will eventually bring its reward.}}
{{rival}}{{/ˈraɪvl}}{{n./adj./v. 竞争对手；竞争的}}{{The two companies have been rivals for years.}}
{{rob}}{{/rɒb}}{{v. 抢劫；剥夺}}{{The bank was robbed last night.}}
{{routine}}{{/ruːˈtiːn}}{{n./adj. 常规；日常的}}{{Exercise is part of her daily routine.}}
{{ruin}}{{/ˈruːɪn}}{{v./n. 毁灭；废墟}}{{The earthquake ruined many historic buildings.}}
{{rural}}{{/ˈrʊərəl}}{{adj. 农村的；乡下的}}{{Rural areas often lack access to healthcare.}}
{{sacrifice}}{{/ˈsækrɪfaɪs}}{{n./v. 牺牲；献祭}}{{She sacrificed her career to raise her children.}}
{{sample}}{{/ˈsɑːmpl}}{{n./v. 样品；取样}}{{The company distributed free samples of the new product.}}
{{satellite}}{{/ˈsætəlaɪt}}{{n. 卫星}}{{The satellite orbits the earth at high speed.}}
{{scale}}{{/skeɪl}}{{n. 规模；比例尺；天平}}{{The project is on a large scale.}}
{{scandal}}{{/ˈskændl}}{{n. 丑闻；耻辱}}{{The political scandal shocked the nation.}}
{{scheme}}{{/skiːm}}{{n./v. 计划；方案；阴谋}}{{The government launched a new healthcare scheme.}}
{{scope}}{{/skəʊp}}{{n. 范围；机会}}{{The scope of the research is quite broad.}}
{{sector}}{{/ˈsektər}}{{n. 部门；领域；扇形}}{{The technology sector has grown rapidly.}}
{{secure}}{{/sɪˈkjʊər}}{{adj./v. 安全的；获得；保护}}{{Make sure the windows are secure before leaving.}}
{{seek}}{{/siːk}}{{v. 寻求；追求}}{{She sought advice from her mentor.}}
{{segment}}{{/ˈseɡmənt}}{{n. 部分；片段；段}}{{The market is divided into several segments.}}
{{select}}{{/sɪˈlekt}}{{v. 选择；挑选}}{{She selected the best candidate for the job.}}
{{senior}}{{/ˈsiːniər}}{{adj./n. 年长的；高级的；前辈}}{{He is a senior officer in the army.}}
{{sensitive}}{{/ˈsensətɪv}}{{adj. 敏感的；灵敏的}}{{She is very sensitive to criticism.}}
{{severe}}{{/sɪˈvɪər}}{{adj. 严重的；严厉的；严峻的}}{{The region suffered severe drought last summer.}}
{{shift}}{{/ʃɪft}}{{v./n. 转变；轮班}}{{There has been a shift in public opinion.}}
{{signal}}{{/ˈsɪɡnəl}}{{n./v. 信号；示意}}{{The traffic signal turned red.}}
{{significant}}{{/sɪɡˈnɪfɪkənt}}{{adj. 重要的；显著的}}{{There has been a significant improvement in air quality.}}
{{similar}}{{/ˈsɪmɪlər}}{{adj. 相似的；类似的}}{{The two proposals are very similar in nature.}}
{{simplify}}{{/ˈsɪmplɪfaɪ}}{{v. 简化；使简明}}{{The new software simplifies the process.}}
{{site}}{{/saɪt}}{{n. 地点；网站}}{{The construction site is fenced off for safety.}}
{{sophisticated}}{{/səˈfɪstɪkeɪtɪd}}{{adj. 复杂的；精密的；老练的}}{{The system uses sophisticated technology.}}
{{source}}{{/sɔːs}}{{n. 来源；源头}}{{The river is the main source of water for the town.}}
{{specific}}{{/spəˈsɪfɪk}}{{adj. 具体的；特定的}}{{Can you give a specific example?}}
{{speculate}}{{/ˈspekjuleɪt}}{{v. 推测；投机}}{{Scientists speculate about the origin of the universe.}}
{{sponsor}}{{/ˈspɒnsər}}{{n./v. 赞助者；赞助}}{{The event was sponsored by a major corporation.}}
{{stable}}{{/ˈsteɪbl}}{{adj./n. 稳定的；马厩}}{{The patient is now in a stable condition.}}
{{standard}}{{/ˈstændəd}}{{n./adj. 标准；标准的}}{{The product meets international quality standards.}}
{{status}}{{/ˈsteɪtəs}}{{n. 地位；状态；身份}}{{The project's current status is on schedule.}}
{{steady}}{{/ˈstedi}}{{adj./v. 稳定的；使稳固}}{{The economy has shown steady growth.}}
{{stimulate}}{{/ˈstɪmjuleɪt}}{{v. 刺激；激发}}{{The new policy aims to stimulate economic growth.}}
{{strategy}}{{/ˈstrætədʒi}}{{n. 策略；战略}}{{The company developed a new marketing strategy.}}
{{stress}}{{/stres}}{{n./v. 压力；强调；重音}}{{She is under a lot of stress at work.}}
{{strict}}{{/strɪkt}}{{adj. 严格的；精确的}}{{The school has strict rules about uniforms.}}
{{structure}}{{/ˈstrʌktʃər}}{{n./v. 结构；构造；组织}}{{The structure of the building is very modern.}}
{{struggle}}{{/ˈstrʌɡl}}{{v./n. 斗争；挣扎；努力}}{{She struggled to balance work and family.}}
{{submit}}{{/səbˈmɪt}}{{v. 提交；服从；屈从}}{{Please submit your application by the deadline.}}
{{substance}}{{/ˈsʌbstəns}}{{n. 物质；实质；根据}}{{The chemical substance is highly toxic.}}
{{substitute}}{{/ˈsʌbstɪtjuːt}}{{n./v. 替代品；代替}}{{Honey can be used as a substitute for sugar.}}
{{subtle}}{{/ˈsʌtl}}{{adj. 微妙的；精细的；巧妙的}}{{There is a subtle difference between the two words.}}
{{succeed}}{{/səkˈsiːd}}{{v. 成功；继任}}{{She succeeded in passing the exam.}}
{{sufficient}}{{/səˈfɪʃnt}}{{adj. 足够的；充分的}}{{The evidence is sufficient to prove his innocence.}}
{{suggest}}{{/səˈdʒest}}{{v. 建议；暗示；表明}}{{I suggest we take a different approach.}}
{{summarize}}{{/ˈsʌməraɪz}}{{v. 总结；概括}}{{Please summarize the main points of the article.}}
{{superior}}{{/suːˈpɪəriər}}{{adj./n. 优越的；上级}}{{This product is superior in quality.}}
{{supplement}}{{/ˈsʌplɪmənt}}{{n./v. 补充；增刊}}{{She takes vitamin supplements daily.}}
{{supply}}{{/səˈplaɪ}}{{v./n. 供给；供应}}{{The company supplies goods to local stores.}}
{{support}}{{/səˈpɔːt}}{{v./n. 支持；支撑；赡养}}{{The evidence supports the theory.}}
{{supreme}}{{/suːˈpriːm}}{{adj. 最高的；至上的}}{{The Supreme Court made the final decision.}}
{{surplus}}{{/ˈsɜːpləs}}{{n./adj. 剩余；过剩的}}{{The country has a trade surplus.}}
{{surrender}}{{/səˈrendər}}{{v./n. 投降；放弃}}{{The army surrendered after a long siege.}}
{{surround}}{{/səˈraʊnd}}{{v. 包围；围绕}}{{The lake is surrounded by mountains.}}
{{survey}}{{/ˈsɜːveɪ}}{{n./v. 调查；测量；审视}}{{The survey shows that most people support the plan.}}
{{survive}}{{/səˈvaɪv}}{{v. 幸存；存活下来}}{{Only a few passengers survived the crash.}}
{{suspect}}{{/səˈspekt}}{{v./n. 怀疑；嫌疑犯}}{{The police suspected him of theft.}}
{{suspend}}{{/səˈspend}}{{v. 暂停；悬挂；延缓}}{{The school suspended the student for fighting.}}
{{sustain}}{{/səˈsteɪn}}{{v. 维持；承受；遭受}}{{The company cannot sustain such heavy losses.}}
{{symbol}}{{/ˈsɪmbl}}{{n. 象征；符号；标志}}{{The dove is a symbol of peace.}}
{{sympathy}}{{/ˈsɪmpəθi}}{{n. 同情；赞同}}{{I have great sympathy for the victims of the disaster.}}
{{system}}{{/ˈsɪstəm}}{{n. 系统；体制；制度}}{{The education system needs to be reformed.}}
